        "body": "Equifax Inc is a public company headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia, traded under the ticker EFX, with SEC CIK 0000033185. According to its website, it operates as a credit bureau, providing credit reports and credit scores to businesses and consumers, along with identity protection tools that include daily monitoring and alerts.\n\nThe site describes Equifax Complete, a product for monitoring credit and protecting identity, and says that dedicated ID Restoration Specialists work on a customer's behalf to help recover from identity theft. It also offers Spanish-language material covering Equifax credit reports in the United States, credit scores, and money management advice. Much of the site is educational content about how financial behavior affects credit, what appears on credit reports, fraud and identity theft warning signs, debt and credit scores, credit cards, personal finance, and loans.\n\nThe company's legal exposure is concentrated in Georgia, where 105 cases are counted. No individual cases are listed, and the material reviewed does not describe AI products or services.",
